Package: shinyLaravelAuth
Title: Laravel <-> Shiny Authentication Handshake
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R:
    person("Stats4SD", role = c("aut", "cre"),
           email = "office@stats4sd.org")
Description: R-side helpers for authenticating a Shiny app embedded in a
    Laravel/Filament host via a shared-filesystem + postMessage handshake.
    Provides the browser-side message handler script and a server-side
    handshake that registers a private callback URL, advertises it to the
    Laravel parent, and exposes the authorised user context as reactive
    values. Mirrors the 'stats4sd/laravel-shiny-loader' Composer package on
    the R side.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
Roxygen: list(markdown = TRUE)
RoxygenNote: 8.0.0
Imports:
    shiny,
    jsonlite,
    stringi,
    stringr
